istle The closing minutes were marked by increasing tension and a flurry of activity on the touchline. Abdullah Matuq picked up a yellow card in the 86th minute as the physical intensity peaked. In a final roll of the dice during stoppage time, Raed Al Shanqiti replaced Musa Barrow , but the breakthrough remained elusive. After five minutes of added time, the referee brought the proceedings to a close. The goalless draw serves as a testament to the defensive solidity of both Al Khaleej Saihat and Al Shabab , who each take home a hard-earned point from this demanding Pro League fixture."
